<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    作用：读取"求生之路 2 / Source 引擎"的模型文件（VPK 归档、MDL、VVD、VTX、jigglebone 参数）。
    Purpose: Reads Left 4 Dead 2 / Source engine model files (VPK archives, MDL, VVD, VTX, jigglebone parameters).

    这个工程刻意**没有任何引用**（零 PackageReference、零 ProjectReference）。
    它只认识 Source 的文件格式，完全不认识 HD2：不引用 HD2ModAdaptation、不认识 Unit、不认识 Patch。
    这条边界不是靠目录约定，而是靠编译器强制——一旦有人在这里 using 一个 HD2 类型，构建就会失败。
    This project deliberately has NO references at all (no PackageReference, no ProjectReference).
    It knows Source file formats and nothing about HD2: it cannot see Unit or Patch types.
    The boundary is enforced by the compiler rather than by folder discipline, so a stray
    `using` of an HD2 type fails the build instead of quietly welding the two layers together.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
